Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.56,0:13:47.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}カゲトカゲをオーバーレイ！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}影蜥蜴叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.09,0:13:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}２体のモンスターで\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用２只怪兽
