Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.46,0:15:15.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}遊馬…。\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.14,0:15:17.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}俺は絶対あきらめねえ！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝对不会放弃！
